u can also try out your first <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime\">Slime</a> here.<br/> \nIf all the killing makes you thirsty, you can go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Karl\">Karl</a>'s bar to spend your freshly earned gold on a <a href=\"#/wiki/Mug\">mug</a> of expensive <a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">Beer</a> and have a chat with your fellow customers <a href=\"#/wiki/Toothless%20Tim\">Toothless Tim</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/William\">William</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"padding-top:1px;overflow:auto\">\nHouses <a href=\"#/quest/the-exterminator-quest\">The Exterminator Quest</a>. You also need to go here for a mission of the <a href=\"#/quest/kissing-a-pig-quest\">Kissing a Pig Quest</a>.</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>NPCs in Carlin Sewers (3 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Karl\">Karl</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Karl\"><img alt=\"Karl\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Karl_779a18.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Rebel</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Carlin Sewers</strong>.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Toothless%20Tim\">Toothless Tim</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Toothless%20Tim\"><img alt=\"Toothless Tim\" class=\"mw-fil